DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44700::$$$message_0389_0000_0000$$$::"SE.RA.PH's famous Tsukuyomi Bath is now open! It heals your HP, stabilizes your mind, soothes lower back pain, and makes your skin positively glow!"::
44701::$$$message_0389_0000_0001$$$::"That's right, girly Servants who want to win your Masters over. I'm talking to you WADARCO. I know your shoulders are as stiff as boulders from being hunched over a desk all day."::
44702::$$$message_0389_0000_0002$$$::"Come experience the hottest spa experience of the season!"::
44703::$$$message_0389_0000_0003$$$::"Kotomine, I'll take one Emperor! And give me the special post-bath massage course!"::
44704::$$$message_0389_0000_0004$$$::"Aaah! This cypress is sooo well made![humming] Baths really do need to be all hardwood. That old Showa-era aroma perks my ears and tail right up!"::
44705::$$$message_0389_0000_0005$$$::"We have two new guests coming in! Ah, Archer. Not you. Once you're done polishing the floor in the men's bath, I need you to take a look at the boiler room. Here, take this wrench."::
44706::$$$message_0389_0000_0006$$$::"I can't believe it...How did it come to this?"::
44708::$$$message_0389_0000_0008$$$::"Whew... This is heaven on Earth. I mean, the stone baths, sand baths, electric jacuzzis... Truly, it was a moment of heaven."::
44710::$$$message_0389_0000_0010$$$::"(gulp, gulp) The delectable taste of cold milk after a hot bath... Ah, nectar of the gods."::
44711::$$$message_0389_0000_0011$$$::"Indeed. Tropical spas have their charm, but Japanese resorts are something else... I don't mind this rocking chair, either. In fact, I like it."::
44712::$$$message_0389_0000_0012$$$::"My people could learn much from Japanese ingenuity. Actually, their attention to detail on a universal scale is a little freakish."::
44713::$$$message_0389_0000_0013$$$::"I will take Maestro as my consort, and, when I ascend the Cyber Emperor's throne, I will conscript... no, protect them...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=セイバーext face=喜 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfangry layer=2] (yawwwwwn...)"::
44714::$$$message_0389_0000_0014$$$::"That sounds nice... I've always thought that the Moon Cell doesn't have enough Kusatsu-style onsen."::
44715::$$$message_0389_0000_0015$$$::"My dream is an intimate stroll with my husband along the western riverbank, wearing matching kimono... [wvl][hfwww layer=2](squeal) I can't wait! Attendant, another bottle of milk, please!"::
44716::$$$message_0389_0000_0016$$$::"Thank you kindly, Archer. Please bring that beautiful lady a drink. After that, start chopping wood."::
44717::$$$message_0389_0000_0017$$$::"Ugh... Fine."::
44718::$$$message_0389_0000_0018$$$::"I'll just accept that we were summoned by the Holy Grail Onsen, which was created when the Moon Cell processed Saber's wish for a giant bathhouse."::
44719::$$$message_0389_0000_0019$$$::"I'm an adult. I'm used to these two jerking me around. But I refuse to be treated like some errand boy!"::
44720::$$$message_0389_0000_0020$$$::"I've spent years sculpting this physique, and now it's time! To reveal it! Here! That's what it means to be a seasoned hero!"::
44721::$$$message_0389_0000_0021$$$::"Eh, save it for the Zero folks."::
44722::$$$message_0389_0000_0022$$$::"Yes, they certainly are a feast for the eyes... I'd love to fight them in the lunar sea, someday."::
44723::$$$message_0389_0000_0023$$$::"Really? We've already got plenty of newcomers. I wouldn't mind having fewer rivals, you know."::
44724::$$$message_0389_0000_0024$$$::"You worry too much, Casko. I can beat them on my own, anyway. It's no different than a few playable Servants getting added."::
44725::$$$message_0389_0000_0025$$$::"I'm rather fond of that gold one, myself. Gold is good. It expresses wordly desire. Maybe I'll have a talk with him the next time we meet."::
44726::$$$message_0389_0000_0026$$$::"Huh!? Don't be absurd, you idiot! [wvl][hfwww layer=2]The last thing we need is another troublesome Servant!"::

